  "body": "Maintainer request from #1452 (\"We should be able to load DXF file to do profile cuts on.\").\n\nDepends on #1864.\n\n## Goal\nLet `Pocket`, `Adaptive2D`, and `Offset2D` machine closed DXF sketch chains and layers, including outer pockets with island holes.\n\n## Scope\n- Extend `selection_region` (`crates/app/src/operation/selection.rs`) and `collect_job` (`crates/app/src/operation/job.rs`) so `Pocket`, `Adaptive2D`, and `Offset2D` resolve selected DXF sketch chains and layers into closed `geo2d::Region`s.\n- Preserve nested outer-loop vs island-hole relationships from #1861 when building pocket regions.\n- Apply sketch `Location` and setup alignment transforms (`crates/app/src/setup_align.rs`).\n- Refuse any open DXF sketch chain selected for `Pocket`, `Adaptive2D`, or `Offset2D` with a clear named error (matching the existing open-run refusal in `selection.rs`).\n- Verify and simulate paths against setup stock cleanly when no 3D part mesh stands in the setup (`part_solid = false`).\n\n## Done means\n`Pocket`, `Adaptive2D`, and `Offset2D` generate verified toolpaths, stock removal, and golden CL from closed DXF sketch boundaries containing inner islands without a 3D mesh; selecting an open sketch chain returns a named error.\n\nPart of #1452\n",
